<title>HONG KONG: Kwong Hing Int'l IPO 8.35 times oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Kwong Hing Int'l IPO 8.35 times oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based knitted fabrics manufacturer Kwong Hing International Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its initial public offering of shares had been 8.35 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Kwong Hing offered 45 million shares at HK$1.20 each. Trading of the shares is expected to start on March 19. The sponsor and manager of the offer is Standard Chartered Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
